  "title": "Entropy-Centric Explainable AI for Remote Sensing Image Segmentation",
  "summary": "This paper proposes an entropy-centric approach to explainable AI (XAI) for remote sensing image segmentation, aiming to improve transparency and understanding of complex decision-making processes in AI models. Experimental results show the superiority of the proposed XAI method compared to existing approaches.",
