      "statement": "This study focuses on improving the reliability and transparency of AI decision-making in remote sensing applications.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The proposed method uses entropy as a key factor to explain the regions highlighted in image segmentation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
